OL,3,GNEWSARural communities hit by bank
OL,4,Abranch closures - MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure of face-to-face banking
OL,7,Fservices has left small businesses and
OL,8,Fcommunities "struggling", an MP says.
OL,10,FSouth Devon MP Caroline Voaden said the
OL,11,Fclosure of 6,000 bank and building
OL,12,Fsociety branches nationally in the last
OL,13,F10 years had "the biggest impact on the
OL,14,Fmost vulnerable people, the elderly,
OL,15,Fthe disabled, those who can't use
OL,16,Fonline services".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
