OL,3,GNEWSARural communities hit by bank
OL,4,Abranch closures - MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Liberal Democrat told a
OL,7,Fparliamentary debate the closure of the
OL,8,Flast bank in Totnes, Devon, meant
OL,9,Fpeople faced a 13-mile (21km)
OL,10,Fround-trip to Paignton to visit the
OL,11,Flast remaining branch in her
OL,12,Fconstituency.
OL,14,FLink, which runs banking hubs, said it
OL,15,Fwas "satisfied" communities had "good
OL,16,Faccess to cash" through post offices
OL,17,Fand cash machines.
